<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine May producer prices rise 0.3 percent m/m.</title>
<headline>Ukraine May producer prices rise 0.3 percent m/m.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's producer prices rose 0.3 percent in May after rising 0.9 percent in April, the Statistics Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    UKRAINE PRODUCER PRICES   May 97   Apr 97   May 96</p>
<p>    mth/mth (pct)		 +0.3     +0.9     +0.8</p>
<p>The ministry did not provide year-on-year figures.</p>
<p>The government has forecast a producer price rise of no more than 14.3 percent this year. Producer prices rose 17.3 percent in 1996 after 172.1 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 244-9150</p>
</text>
